{"id":"n92526-1-9","stage":3,"title":"돌려보내다 · 送回","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n92526-1-9-1","ko":"내 앞으로 택배 안 왔어?","zh":"寄给我的快递还没到吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내","audio":"/audio/b3378685b76ee79fd0ef.mp3"}},{"text":"앞으로","meaning":"寄给我、以我为收件人","explanation":"앞：寄给某人的、以某人为收件人的（-의 앞으로）；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"8","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앞으로","audio":"/audio/cb4897c6b6949e02da6d.mp3"}},{"text":"택배","meaning":"快递","explanation":"택배：快递","readings":[{"term":"택배","audio":"/audio/b63128abe65a84d203c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"80833","senseId":"1","lemma":"택배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"택배","audio":"/audio/b63128abe65a84d203c7.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"왔어?","meaning":"来，传来","explanation":"오다：来，传来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"6","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왔어","audio":"/audio/1c7a0c0d37b0eadd46f3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"寄给某人的、以某人为收件人的（-의 앞으로）","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"寄给某人的、以某人为收件人的（-의 앞으로）","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"b63128abe65a84d2","term":"택배","zh":"快递","audio":"/audio/b63128abe65a84d203c7.mp3","entryId":"80833","definition":"将邮件、行李、商品等直接送到指定的地方。","pronunciation":["택빼"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，传来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"消息或联系等被转达给某人。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/fa5032aff3522179424e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n92526-1-9-2","ko":"왔었는데 물건이 찌그러져 와서 돌려보냈어.","zh":"来过，但东西送来时都压瘪了，我就退回去了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왔었는데","meaning":"来，传来","explanation":"오다：来，传来；었었：回顾已经结束或与现在情况有区别的过去。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"6","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왔었는데","audio":"/audio/9f66e98dda45ed28af8b.mp3"}},{"text":"물건이","meaning":"东西，物品，物件","explanation":"물건：东西，物品，物件；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"물건","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66247","senseId":"1","lemma":"물건","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물건이","audio":"/audio/467d4d94d33d4871f929.mp3"}},{"text":"찌그러져","meaning":"瘪，压瘪，压缩","explanation":"찌그러지다：瘪，压瘪，压缩；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"찌그러지다","audio":"/audio/42468453660258f43c78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78971","senseId":"1","lemma":"찌그러지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찌그러져","audio":"/audio/9f8453e3ec1e5aab4489.mp3"}},{"text":"와서","meaning":"来，传来","explanation":"오다：来，传来；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"6","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"와서","audio":"/audio/fff1948ffcab0f48d739.mp3"}},{"text":"돌려보냈어.","meaning":"送回，送还，退回","explanation":"돌려보내다：送回，送还，退回；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"돌려보내다","audio":"/audio/f3e1b806d0f631318a58.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92526","senseId":"1","lemma":"돌려보내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돌려보냈어","audio":"/audio/a6da4dd84963632f2e7c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，传来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"消息或联系等被转达给某人。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"df279371093362d8","term":"물건","zh":"东西，物品，物件","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3","entryId":"66247","definition":"具有一定形状的某种物质。","pronunciation":["물건"]},{"id":"42468453660258f4","term":"찌그러지다","zh":"瘪，压瘪，压缩","audio":"/audio/42468453660258f43c78.mp3","entryId":"78971","definition":"使劲按压，导致表面产生不均匀的褶皱，塌陷下去。","pronunciation":["찌그러지다"]},{"id":"f3e1b806d0f63131","term":"돌려보내다","zh":"送回，送还，退回","audio":"/audio/f3e1b806d0f631318a58.mp3","entryId":"92526","definition":"使人或东西返回到原来的地方。","pronunciation":["돌려보내다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f4290bb6f201916025c6.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.19,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=92526","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":116,"sequenceScore":3.0167,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["寄给我的快递还没到吗？","来过，但东西送来时都压瘪了，我就退回去了。","你现在还害怕坐车吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["没有寄给我的快递吗？","来过，但东西送来时都压瘪了，我就退回去了。","你现在还害怕坐车吗？"],"answer":1}]}
